==Właściwości==

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
A PartDesign '''PointPattern''' object is derived from a [[...]] object and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
=== Data ===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
{{Properties_Title|Base}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Originals|LinkList}}: A list of selected features. Will be ignored, if the {{PropertyData|Transform Mode}} property is set to {{value|Whole shape}}.
* {{PropertyData|TransformMode|Enumeration}}: 
*: {{value|Features}} (default)
*: {{value|Whole shape}}.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
{{Properties_Title|Part Design}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Refine|Bool|}}: Default is {{value|True}}. Refine shape (clean up redundant edges) after operations.
* {{PropertyData|Fuzzy Tolerance|FloatConstraint|}}: Default is {{value|-1.0}}. Fuzzy tolerance:
*: If value > 0: use the value
*: If value = 0: leave default value
*: If value < 0: determine value
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
{{Properties_Title|PointPattern}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|OriginPointIndex|Integer|hidden}}: Default is {{value|0}}. The origin point index, used for the identity transformation.
* {{PropertyData|PointObject|LinkSub}}: Sketch or shape object whose vertices define the pattern positions.
* {{PropertyData|RelativeToFirst|Bool}}: Default is {{value|False}}. Moves all transformations relative to the first one.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
{{Properties_Title|Transformation}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|SuppressedIndices|IntegerList}}: Indices of pattern instances that are suppressed.
</div>


